id: pmc-k1oq
title: Include extension-registered item types in changelog generation and body previews
description: pm-changelog 2026.9.23 resolves configured item types but omits active extension registrations. A closed Changeset created by the version-control package is visible in pm list but absent from changelog generation. Resolve the active registry through the public SDK for enumeration and body enrichment.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-25T15:00:50.960Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-25T15:05:07.236Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-25T15:05:05.983Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-25T15:05:05.983Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: Generate and export include an extension-registered Changeset alongside configured Story and built-in Task; body preview loads its real body; regression fails before the fix; package gates pass.
resolution: Pass the active extension registrations to the public SDK type resolver in both metadata and body paths.
expected_result: Extension-defined items appear in generated and exported changelogs with body previews.
actual_result: "The real SDK fixture fails before the patch with 2 of 3 records and passes afterward with Task, Story and Changeset plus its real body. Full package coverage and documentation gates pass."
